{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":120,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"*Cantique des degrés. À l’Éternel, en ma détresse, j’ai crié ; et il m’a répondu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Éternel ! délivre mon âme de la lèvre menteuse, de la langue qui trompe.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Que te donnera-t-on, et que t’ajoutera-t-on, langue trompeuse","poem":1},{"noteId":397},{"text":"? –","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Des flèches aiguës d’un homme puissant, et des charbons ardents de genêt.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Malheur à moi de ce que je séjourne en Méshec, de ce que je demeure avec les tentes de Kédar ; –","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Que mon âme ait tant demeuré avec ceux qui haïssent la paix !","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Je veux la paix ; mais si j’en parle, ils sont, eux, pour la guerre.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":397,"caller":"a","text":"ou : Que te donnera et t’ajoutera la langue trompeuse ?","reference":{"chapter":120,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/120.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/121.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/119.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}